{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_title", "source_sha256": "c4fbbbcf7005b51608414fc938e9c5609c1926e3b8cef91b42fa3cfa0fed9f7e", "ja": "月影の庭で", "zh": "月影之庭", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8d981e10841daed9171cc02f864d175eb2d8a74c11645e35d3cec3c39c396350", "ja": "劇場公演が決まった貴音。貴音を支えると\nはりきる後輩たちの姿に触れ、目的の曖昧な\n今の自分に引け目を感じるが、大切なのは望\nむ道を往くことと思い至り、未知の輝きの先\nへと踏み出していく。", "zh": "确定要举行剧场公演的贵音。看着干劲十足\n表示要支持自己的后辈们，她为如今目标模糊\n的自己感到自愧不如。但贵音想通了关键在于\n走自己渴望的道路，并迈向了未知的辉煌前方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "03d8ecc967f5c603e69120ca6c034e14a762bdae4d2babb418490d48e2a08c98", "ja": "本日は、私のセンター公演にお越しいただき、\nありがとうございました。", "zh": "感谢各位今天莅临我担任中心位的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "c1afc2dca199f107abb20351ac8087fa81d9f1499ffc493d7186136a39c56c12", "ja": "素晴らしい時間を過ごせたのも、笑顔と応援の数々を\n届けてくださった皆様のおかげです。", "zh": "能够度过如此美好的时光，也多亏了大家带来的无数笑容与支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "6eabc4cac68c99e00f7e3b28c622556309f0524f2523639987f50945d2e80bc7", "ja": "ワアアアアア……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "0a55c7de196f5e66c5ad02fd58fecb866bbc46a44e8705c7717209ba43b518de", "ja": "そして、この劇場での公演を支えてくれた\n仲間にも感謝いたします。", "zh": "另外，也要感谢一直支持着剧场公演的伙伴们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "4bd4ebe5c7d6ec9e164e61c0c2e1b5756a6179861655a41961864f8ec252bf55", "ja": "私は、これからもこのステージに立ち続けます。\nまた劇場でお会いしましょう！", "zh": "今后我也会继续站在这个舞台上。\n我们剧场再见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fb6e5b9b5038dac812354c49d315299486e7d9aefe56a99ccc540e6ad2f84b2a", "ja": "（幕が閉じた後も、お客さんの笑顔と歓声は、\nいつまでもステージに向けられていた……）", "zh": "（帷幕落下后，观众们的笑容与欢呼声，依然久久朝向舞台……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "1cccb97b99787129f5fb801ef2bb7bd3d2df23c09426593e33578ea7dab6a19d", "ja": "貴音さま、お疲れ様です！\n主役としての振る舞い、とても勉強になりました！", "zh": "贵音大人，辛苦了！您作为主角的表现，让我学到了很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "b72259e50ecfb2f9ff214812d88abe65dbce9db5a13ec987617ab8c6df69e603", "ja": "貴音さんに近づけたと思っていましたが、\nまだまだでした。……いつか、超えてみせるぞ。", "zh": "我本以为已经更接近贵音小姐了，看来还差得远。……总有一天，我一定会超越她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "8e44759a1b72c731bc31fe292ac263b9a251ad633663e9b4d23bbcb53122b08c", "ja": "お疲れ様でした。\n皆の力添えに、心から感謝いたします。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n衷心感谢大家的鼎力相助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "dbcbad466a6d8cf8f3b3708168c8afd31c5326664fc7d2832056acb33841b740", "ja": "貴音さんの魅力が、\nぎゅ～っと詰まった素敵な公演でしたね～。", "zh": "这是场将贵音小姐的魅力紧紧凝聚在一起的精彩演出呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "aa233cffe3e3e11a146de2a08fa21467ecca4258e40851a1c17236ee6127567f", "ja": "オーディエンスとタカネのパッションがフュージョン\nした、とってもエキサイティングなステージでした！", "zh": "这是观众与贵音的热情相融合，令人无比兴奋的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "8171ed55a78da1cbb93544cc2c3ac71caa6aec59b09dca03cdfc09f75482be4c", "ja": "そう言ってもらえると、私も誇らしいです。\nふふっ……ここは、温かい場所ですね。", "zh": "听你这么说，我也感到很自豪。\n呵呵……这里真是个温暖的地方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1013_p", "source_sha256": "83501f8d944c62bcea65700b172b152ec9cd8421dd09f108b757e7d8ece9ff97", "ja": "お待たせ……って、貴音だけか？", "zh": "让你这么说，我也感到很自豪。\n呵呵……这里真是个温暖的地方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "571559e9cef2153a0506b15d001151f5832472cf439ad2fce904031b26c89c2f", "ja": "はい。皆もすぐに支度が終わるかと。\n私は、風に当たろうと思いまして……。", "zh": "是的。大家应该也马上就能准备好了。\n我想出来吹吹风……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1015_p", "source_sha256": "88b0f62f6fac93ae325bead6301538d4fe571693e532af27b895b0be022c2816", "ja": "そうか。それじゃ、一緒に待たせてもらうよ。", "zh": "这样啊。那我就和你一起等吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "7e7776eb3d340289ca24411741a062baf22f8ca4059ff2e22ff6dab42fd9ab5f", "ja": "あの、{$P$}……。\n公演を終えて、改めて感じたことがあります。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}……\n公演结束之后，我再次体会到了一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "9a9505b8950eb403dab6608c5c4d29f881f8cb1f1e1a28dbf7641a93f6f6596a", "ja": "本日は、ファンや仲間の笑顔が、力となりました。\nそして、皆もまた私の歌が力になって……。", "zh": "今天，粉丝和伙伴们的笑容成为了我的力量。\n而大家也同样从我的歌声中获得了力量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "294771eefab315841e5d517737e88a9fa0a1ba9a7ee623a6d107c09dd4cf9f11", "ja": "皆が求めてくれる限り、ここにいたいと……\n思いを強くしました。", "zh": "只要大家还需要我，我就想一直留在这里……\n我更加坚定了这个想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1019_p", "source_sha256": "84de033f5443d7b98604170bb15c5b85fed3e4afc9fbc79ccc070f3c2f4c8aeb", "ja": "それはよかった！", "zh": "那太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "0f305a352853cbce023b40e7f38b769ea8ae09a033565a65089cd1501dfbefd3", "ja": "ただ、それは少しだけ未来の話。\n遠い未来となると、はっきりとは見えておりません。", "zh": "不过，那只是稍微近一些的未来。\n至于遥远的未来，我还看不清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "f1082beee31be00c36572b07e7504ac1cebc96defce5c7d96866bfa72e74e43d", "ja": "{$P$}の言うように、\n近い未来から、歩みを進めようと思います。", "zh": "正如{$P$}所言，\n我想先从眼前的未来开始，一步步向前迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f245aecbb7c183178cea0da4475c10f24970adbc07cbaab5e09c7c3dc741fc89", "ja": "ああ、それでいいと思う。\n貴音には貴音の歩みがあるからな。", "zh": "啊，我觉得这样就好。\n因为贵音有属于自己的道路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "841f99cb3d895dd4060791f16565511d87b641dfe086ca83a5ffd1e78852a0c2", "ja": "はい。ですが、高みへ至るには、\n遥かに遠い未来を望まなければなりません。", "zh": "是。不过，要抵达更高之处，就必须期盼遥远得多的未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "fdd90102950ffc564e70713aad734db5f55ebc6b9246f725be117648fd1e2a8a", "ja": "おそらく、未熟な私では、\n到底、想像もできない未来かもしれません……。", "zh": "或许，那是即使不成熟的我，也完全无法想象的未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "58e59fc6071969cfd780958e93e1b9bf0ddffee1476ea24526e9d669c0896aff", "ja": "それでも、{$P$}……\nこれからも、共に歩んでいただけますか？", "zh": "即便如此，{$P$}……\n今后也愿意与我一同走下去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_1026", "source_sha256": "fdc2c95f4a3e2966d6f22c408b7bc0e064c934a8087678df4f9607c093fe3315", "ja": "任せてくれ！", "zh": "包在我身上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9137a77bf6f823024672111262d960eb423214a4ea38b58a5e2eeab7144da9fb", "ja": "任せてくれ。\n貴音が未来を見つけられるように、俺も手伝うよ。", "zh": "交给我吧。\n为了让贵音能找到未来，我也会帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_2001_008tak", "source_sha256": "931aa51ebc72a908b539cbb43712f9aa01ee0ab15706eb391ba8c49b0cd18d50", "ja": "心強いお言葉、ありがとうございます。\n今後とも、よろしくお願いいたします……あなた様。", "zh": "您这番话让我感到十分安心，非常感谢。\n今后也请多多关照了……殿下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_2002_044miz", "source_sha256": "257a37dec6146a3c131b8a2843888ba6f882442417445e383a0997c290f4fbe7", "ja": "じー……。", "zh": "（盯）…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_2003_p", "source_sha256": "6b1ef312f7450b5a2438040570df1081db01ee774c9284a84b0e4c83fc4f45d2", "ja": "わっ！　み、瑞希！？", "zh": "哇！瑞、瑞希！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_2004_044miz", "source_sha256": "57e1e8d3d1ac24b26f73692ceddb64d9d8ebd7a40ffbba048adb8b41badc7467", "ja": "なにやら邪魔をしてはいけない雰囲気だったので、\n空気を読んでみました。……えらいぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "感觉好像不该打扰，所以我识趣了一下。……真乖啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_2005_032emi", "source_sha256": "b9f0fa1f688e6622b521a8e774dcaa284a0c635a8320a65806419eeea5b4ec49", "ja": "お待たせいたしました！\nおふたりで、何を話していらっしゃったのですか？", "zh": "让您久等了！刚才两位在聊什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_2006_008tak", "source_sha256": "50bd6ad62b2dc6e9ad8809fb5afa2f6f2fcfbc499c2a5e9b5b8860f8696a30d1", "ja": "ふふっ……この先の話を少しだけ。", "zh": "呵呵……只是稍微聊了聊接下来的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_051_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_051_2007_032emi", "source_sha256": "eefbcffd23d4798ddf9d430062172938ab77bcb09b6f308817dcea819526a45f", "ja": "この先のお話ですか？", "zh": "是接下来要说的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
